  "encoding_evidence": "Strict cp1252 decodes all members. 0x92/0x94/0x96 occur as punctuation, rejecting ISO-8859-1 controls; 0xA0 is no-break space and 0xA7 is section sign. Non-ASCII members fail UTF-8. 0xBF is retained as U+00BF without interpreting its intended character.",
  "date_representations": "Raw M/D/YYYY, blanks, and REMARK_DATE also M/D/YYYY h:mm:ss AM/PM; 1/1/1900 occurs as an approval date and is not interpreted.",
  "unknowns": ["The intended character behind upstream 0xBF substitutions is not established.","The G37022 segregation remark names no predecessor lease; no dedicated predecessor field is observed in the inventory. A source-backed rule or maintainer decision will be needed for normalized history.","Operator designations are observed in remark text; no dedicated operator-designation field is observed. Exhaustive extraction is deferred.","Water-depth and area units are not established by the raw headers; numerical values remain unqualified source strings."],
  "gaps": ["mv_lease_owners_main has no rows for G08487, G18207, G32306 or G35491; all seven G28148 rows are selected.","mv_serreg_lease_owner_groups has no rows for any of the five acceptance leases. Its G02941 encoding regression supplies a source-backed group-to-assignment join only.","DeepQual has no rows for G08487 or G28148; the three available acceptance-lease rows are selected.","The companies member is the candidate owner-name join, inventoried without a fixture. Company-name refresh and completeness remain later work."],
